<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST389"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Warren_b<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Warren_b<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, July 06, 2004 - 11:37 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I guess this doesn&#39;t go here but I didn&#39;t want to start a new thread.  FHM magazine &#40;August 2004&#41; has an article with photos on BTK.  It just hit the newstands and I only had time to skim.  I doubt anything new in it. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
