<!--Post: 396--><!--Time: 1089297319-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST396"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, July 08, 2004 - 7:35 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->What&#39;s FHM magazine? I&#39;m not familiar with it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 396-->
<!--Post: 397--><!--Time: 1089297549-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST397"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Screamer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Screamer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, July 08, 2004 - 7:39 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It&#39;s the men&#39;s magazine similar to Maxiam. One of the one&#39;s with some hot girl on the cover. <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t think this issue has hit my stand yet. I looked for the last 2 days. Is this the issue with Anna Nichol on the cover or Beth O. I keep forgetting to look at the month on it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 397-->
<!--Post: 401--><!--Time: 1089310800-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST401"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Warren_b<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Warren_b<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, July 08, 2004 - 11:20 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->OK, its the issue with Beth Ostorskey on the cover.  It does have some pics I haven&#39;t seen.  It also quotes Hurst Laviania, who got the first of the most recent letters &#40;Vicki Wegerle&#41;. Says in the photos her bra pushed up and pants pulled down.  Did not see that info prior to the article. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
